# Modelfile: Qwen3.5-9B (dense), 48K context — "48k-agentic" tuning, the
# larger-context opencode option (mid-session `/model` switch from
# 32k-agentic, no restart needed — see docs/tuning-results.md for why
# opencode supports this and Copilot CLI doesn't; this is also part of why
# Copilot CLI support was dropped for this model).
#
# Use this over 32k-agentic when a task needs more room (longer tool-use
# session, more files/context) and you're willing to trade some speed for
# it: measured 26.0 gen tok/s / 78%/22% GPU split here vs. 32k-agentic's
# 29.5 tok/s / 81%/19% — see that file's header comment for the full
# 32K/48K/64K comparison table and the dense-vs-MoE reasoning behind why
# this model (unlike qwen3.6:35b-a3b) degrades noticeably per context
# tier. Don't jump straight to 64K here — the extra headroom isn't needed
# given opencode's low ~7,322-token static overhead, and 64K costs
# meaningfully more speed (22.3 gen tok/s, see docs/tuning-results.md).
#
# num_batch left at 256 — see qwen3.5__9b-32k-agentic/Modelfile; tested
# num_batch=128 here too, no measurable benefit.
#
# num_gpu intentionally omitted — let Ollama's own auto-balancer pick
# layer placement from live free VRAM.

FROM qwen3.5:9b

PARAMETER num_ctx 49152
PARAMETER num_batch 256
PARAMETER num_thread 16

# Sampling aligned the same way as qwen3.5__9b-12k-standalone/Modelfile —
# see that file and docs/tuning-results.md ("Unsloth alignment") for the
# full reasoning.
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER presence_penalty 0.0

# 25% of num_ctx for output, same proportion as 32k-agentic.
PARAMETER num_predict 12288

SYSTEM """You are a helpful assistant. Keep your internal reasoning
efficient and proportional to the difficulty of the question — do not
over-deliberate on simple requests. Regardless of how much you have
reasoned, always make sure to produce a clear, complete final answer
before you finish; if you notice you are running low on room to respond,
wrap up your reasoning early and give your best answer rather than leaving
it incomplete.
"""
